identical inside one stderr; served Q4_K_XL DFlash2 **tie**, plain arm **noise**, rolled40 **37/37**. Receipts under `2026-09-14-lane-234-r48-kernels/100-r64-q5k-route/` and `2026-09-02-lane-209/r64-lane-252/c24-q4kxl-27b/SEAT/AB.json`. **Expected served effect is small by construction and a large one would be a red flag:** ~**+0.7% at n=5**, ceiling ~**+1.8% at n=8**, **0% at n=4** (inert) - so a tie IS the predicted result, and a gain above ~2% means the attribution is wrong, not the lever better. **Moving the default remains an independent checker's call.** |
